al packing. Performance is exactly as advertised.\"}],\"rating\":4.7,\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\",\"tags\":[],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"hp_gain\":\"$undefined\",\"weight_saved\":\"$undefined\",\"safety_rating\":\"$undefined\"}},\"inventoryQuantity\":\"$undefined\",\"inventoryTracked\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Product/10473519677757\",\"handle\":\"bsddp-aluminium-mirrors-black\",\"title\":\"BSDDP Aluminium Anti Glare Mirrors\",\"description\":\"Experience superior visibility and durability with these premium aluminium mirrors. The anti-glare finish reduces reflections for safer riding in all light conditions, while the rust-free construction ensures long-lasting performance across India's varied climates. Anodized bolts provide corrosion resistance and secure mounting on any motorcycle. Lightweight yet robust, these mirrors combine functionality with a sleek black finish for a professional look that complements any bike setup.\",\"priceRange\":{\"minVariantPrice\":{\"amount\":\"1992.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"}},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/AFCECDD2-1C9A-4F6D-B277-CD64ABC69AF4.jpg?v=1787406468\",\"altText\":\"BSDDP Aluminium Anti Glare Mirrors\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/51389074-CB1C-4833-9D16-DE5B2C7A5DE9.jpg?v=1787406468\",\"altText\":\"BSDDP Aluminium Anti Glare Mirrors\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/7D481527-9DCC-4657-8131-C452AB25B611.jpg?v=1787406468\",\"altText\":\"BSDDP Aluminium Anti Glare Mirrors\"},{\"url\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/files/164D661E-B9DC-47D4-864B-8CB1DE861871.jpg?v=1787406468\",\"altText\":\"BSDDP Aluminium Anti Glare Mirrors\"}],\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/ProductVariant/52880902652221\",\"title\":\"Default Title\",\"price\":{\"amount\":\"1992.0\",\"currencyCode\":\"INR\"},\"compareAtPrice\":{\"am